OL,3,GNEWSAShopping centre fully reopens
OL,4,Aafter roof panel fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shopping centre in West Sussex has
OL,7,Ffully reopened 11 weeks after a glass
OL,8,Fpanel fell from its ceiling.
OL,10,FSwan Walk Shopping Centre in Horsham
OL,11,Fhas been gradually reopening after it
OL,12,Fwas closed on 12 July when an object
OL,13,Fhit a glazing panel and caused it to
OL,14,Ffall. Nobody was injured.
OL,16,F"We're grateful to our retailers, their
OL,17,Femployees and visitors to the centre
OL,18,Ffor their patience," a spokesperson
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
