OL,3,GNEWSAShopping centre fully reopens
OL,4,Aafter roof panel fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnce the cause of the damage was
OL,7,Fconfirmed in an investigation, the
OL,8,Fshopping centre began installing a
OL,9,Fsafety net underneath its glazed areas
OL,10,Fto protect its shoppers and retailers.
